    "Id": "mechdef_hobgoblin_ii_HOBII-FSN",
    "Name": "Hobgoblin II HOBII-FSN",
    "Details": "The N configuration of the Hobgoblin II OmniProtoMech is a nuclear strike platform. Its Fusillade launcher, revived from the original Hobgoblin, fires iATM-ER Fusion missiles whose fusion warheads turn every hit into a nuclear detonation, scorching the area and leaving an electromagnetic pulse behind. The Society built these weapons of last resort after losing many WarShips, and keeps them in high-security vaults, each warhead wrecking itself if tampered with. Its Magnetic Clamp System carries it clear of the blast on a friendly 'Mech, while an LRM-4 and two AP Gauss Rifles serve as backups.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: OmniProtoMech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.978</color></b>",
    "Icon": "Protomech_Gorgon"
  },
